include nav
mixin blog-header()
    
    header#tm-header.tm-header
        .tm-header-wrapper
            button.navbar-toggler(type="button", aria-label="Toggle navigation")
                i.fas.fa-bars
            .tm-site-header
                .mb-3.mx-auto.tm-site-logo
                    i.fas.fa-times.fa-2x
                h1.text-center Xtra Blog
            +nav()
            .tm-mb-65
                a.tm-social-link(rel="nofollow", href="https://fb.com/templatemo")
                    i.fab.fa-facebook.tm-social-icon
                a.tm-social-link(href="https://twitter.com")
                    i.fab.fa-twitter.tm-social-icon
                a.tm-social-link(href="https://instagram.com")
                    i.fab.fa-instagram.tm-social-icon
                a.tm-social-link(href="https://linkedin.com")
                    i.fab.fa-linkedin.tm-social-icon
            p.tm-mb-80.pr-5.text-white
                | Xtra Blog is a multi-purpose HTML template from TemplateMo website. Left side is a sticky menu bar. Right side content will scroll up and down.
